# Inheritance (bastok 68): 191 with hide 0 and option 2. Accepted by GM with the guide alone (no sword, no map: the
# player dropped the sword): 191 with hide 0, option 0 (nothing); the map by GM: 191 with hide 1, option 2 deletes the
# quest (available again), the guide and the map. Then skill 0: not offered, the default 52.
lists BastokMines/Gumbah/onTrigger BastokMines/onEventFinish/191
char zone=BastokMines pos=52,0,-36 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Bastok.BladeOfDarkness completed    # Gumbah's 99 (Blade of Darkness, level 30) out of the way
quest Bastok.Inheritance accepted
keyitem WeaponTrainingGuide
login
trigger Gumbah                    # accepted, no Annals, no sword, no map: 191 with hide 0
finish option=0                # option 0: nothing
keyitem MapToTheAnnalsOfTruth
trigger Gumbah                    # the map: 191 with hide 1
finish option=2                # the quest deleted, the guide and the map deleted
trigger Gumbah                    # available, skill 0: not offered, 52
finish
